%% Sprint Bankroll-Reports-Detail — RF-09 RF-03 RF-07 RF-08 (ADR-069)
%% Sequence: usuario abre WalletTransactionDialog SEM sessao ativa, dialog seleciona reason='manual_report' automatico,
%% submit POST /api/wallets/:id/transactions. walletService valida mutuamente exclusivo (D2), persiste tx (session_id=NULL),
%% dispara createAutoSnapshot best-effort com origin='manual-report' (D3). Coach tool inclui type='manual_report' (D12).
%% Dashboard ROI per platform soma deltaUsd (RF-08). Falha de snapshot logada nao bloqueia tx (mesmo trade-off ADR-058 addendum).

sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Founder
    participant Dlg as WalletTransactionDialog
    participant API as POST /api/wallets/:id/transactions
    participant WS as walletService.recordWalletTransaction
    participant FX as fxResolver (ADR-061)
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant BS as bankrollService.createAutoSnapshot
    participant Coach as readUserBankrollHistory tool
    participant Dash as dashboardService profit calc

    User->>Dlg: Abre /bankroll click Reportar saldo<br/>(sem sessao ativa)
    Dlg->>Dlg: prop sessionId = undefined<br/>auto-select reason='manual_report'
    Dlg->>Dlg: render helper text PT-BR<br/>"Sem sessao ativa - sera registrado como Report manual"
    User->>Dlg: Seleciona wallet PokerStars<br/>informa saldo $1247
    Dlg->>API: POST body<br/>{direction:in, nativeAmount:1247,<br/>reason:'manual_report',<br/>occurredAt: ISO,<br/>sessionId OMITIDO}

    API->>API: WalletTxBodyRefinedSchema.parse(body)

    alt body.sessionId presente E body.reason = manual_report
        API-->>Dlg: 400 manual_report_no_session
        Dlg->>User: erro inline "manual_report nao aceita sessionId"
    else body valido
        API->>WS: recordWalletTransaction(input)

        WS->>DB: BEGIN<br/>SELECT FOR UPDATE wallets WHERE id=?
        DB-->>WS: wallet row (balance, version)

        opt expectedPreviousBalance presente
            WS->>WS: check epsilon 0.01 (ADR-038)
            alt drift detected
                WS->>DB: ROLLBACK
                WS-->>API: throw balance_mismatch 409
                API-->>Dlg: 409 currentBalance
            end
        end

        WS->>FX: resolveExchangeRates(userId)
        FX->>DB: SELECT exchange_rates FROM users
        FX->>DB: SELECT exchange_rates FROM wallets
        DB-->>FX: rates
        FX-->>WS: {rates, source, resolvedAt}

        WS->>WS: deltaNative = +1247 (in)<br/>deltaUsdAtTime = convertToUSD(1247, BRL, rates)<br/>balanceAfterNative = wallet.balance + 1247

        WS->>DB: INSERT wallet_transactions<br/>(reason='manual_report', session_id=NULL,<br/>delta_usd_at_time, balance_after_native,<br/>previous_native_balance = wallet.balance)
        DB-->>WS: tx row

        WS->>DB: UPDATE wallets SET balance=balance_after_native,<br/>version=version+1
        DB-->>WS: ok

        WS->>DB: COMMIT
        WS-->>API: {transaction, wallet}

        Note over API,BS: Snapshot best-effort POS-tx (mesmo padrao ADR-058 addendum)

        API->>BS: createAutoSnapshot({userId,<br/>origin:'manual-report',<br/>sourceRefId: tx.id,<br/>occurredAt: now})

        BS->>WS: getConsolidatedBalanceUSD(userId)
        WS-->>BS: consolidatedUSD<br/>+ wallets_balances jsonb

        BS->>DB: INSERT bankroll_snapshots<br/>(origin='manual-report',<br/>source_ref_id=tx.id,<br/>wallets_balances,<br/>exchange_rates_used)

        alt INSERT erro (CHECK constraint, FK, etc)
            DB-->>BS: error
            BS->>BS: console.error + telemetry<br/>auto_snapshot_failed
            BS-->>API: snapshot=null
        else INSERT ok
            DB-->>BS: snapshot row
            BS-->>API: snapshot
        end

        API-->>Dlg: 200 OK<br/>{transaction, wallet, snapshot?}
        Dlg->>Dlg: invalidate queries<br/>['wallets', 'bankroll-snapshots',<br/>'grind-history', 'dashboard']
        Dlg->>User: Toast "Saldo reportado com sucesso"

        Note over Coach,Dash: Consumidores downstream

        Coach->>DB: SELECT wallet_transactions<br/>WHERE reason='manual_report'<br/>OR reason='session_result'
        DB-->>Coach: ledger entries
        Coach->>Coach: cluster D5 (5min)<br/>map type: 'session' | 'manual_report'
        Coach-->>Coach: tool output com type discriminator<br/>(D12 ADR-069)

        Dash->>DB: SELECT SUM(delta_usd_at_time)<br/>FROM wallet_transactions<br/>WHERE reason IN (session_result, manual_report)<br/>GROUP BY platform
        DB-->>Dash: profit per platform incluindo manual_reports
    end

    Note over API,DB: Fluxo completo: tx commitada SEMPRE; snapshot best-effort.<br/>Idempotencia futura via external_reference (debt). Falha snapshot = log + 200 OK.
